data: {"id": "812ac1a12faa4d0c-thinking-parallel_evidence-1781", "run_id": "812ac1a12faa4d0c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有的 tool_results，我已获得以下关键事实：\n\n### 已采集事实（支持）\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`phase: Running`，但 `Ready: False`，条件为 `ContainersNotReady`（containers with unready status: [app]）。\n2. **CrashLoopBackOff 持续存在**：`containerStatuses[0].app` 显示 `restarts=22`，`reason=CrashLoopBackOff`，`exitCode=2`。Kubelet 持续发出 `Warning BackOff` 事件（x406 over 91m），明确指出 `Back-off restarting failed container app`。\n3. **崩溃前日志证据**：`kubectl_previous_logs` 返回了崩溃前的最后两条日志。关键日志显示：`{\"event\":\"http_request\",\"level\":\"error\",\"message\":\"runtime process e", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788789806882, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "812ac1a12faa4d0c-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "812ac1a12faa4d0c", "seq": 1782, "ts_ms": 1788789815071, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 84.813, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-06", "name": "workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/812ac1a12faa4d0c-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "6f215f9eec761c61258d97543cd971059e8a1fe47fdbadf477c985fa4c45f6a6", "bytes": 2450}, "snapshot_sha256": "5929fdf43563e6c3c2932ee873e3a66fb89bba00409009f0a5e50cf2aa65390e"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "812ac1a12faa4d0c-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "812ac1a12faa4d0c", "seq": 1783, "ts_ms": 1788789815072, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "812ac1a12faa4d0c-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "812ac1a12faa4d0c", "seq": 1784, "ts_ms": 1788789828686, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 13.614, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 2704, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b` | CrashLoopBackOff | App container `app` is crashing repeatedly (exitCode=2, CrashLoopBackOff) due to an unhandled runtime error within the Python application logic (server.py) while handling HTTP requests to `/work`. The logs consistently show a 500 status followed by `runtime process exiting`, indicating the application terminates the process upon encountering this specific internal error condition. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container `app`: `last_terminated_reason=Error`, `waiting_reason=CrashLoopBackOff` | 确认容器异常终止并处于重试等待状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container `app`: `last_exit_code=2`, `restart_count=22` | 确认退出码为 2 且已重启多次 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Back-off restarting failed container app (x406 over 91m) | 确认重启行为持续时间及频率极高 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | pod `workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b`: `ContainersReady=False`, `Ready=False` | 确认 Pod 因容器未就绪而无法提供服务 |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | Log pattern: `http_request error runtime process exiting` (HTTP 500, path `/work`, service `aiops-lab-workload`), count: 3 (13:34 - 13:49) | 确认异常发生在处理 `/work` 请求时，且伴随进程直接退出消息 |\n| 6 | Logging | Elasticsearch | Log pattern: `http_request info request completed` (HTTP 200, path `/work`, service `aiops-lab-workload`), count: 5 | 确认应用能处理其他请求，异常非全局不可用 |\n| 7 | Tracing | Tempo | Span `GET /work` in `aiops-lab-workload` has attribute `aiops.observed_mode: runtime_exit` | 在应用层追踪中确认运行模式异常为退出状态，印证日志现象 |\n| 8 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 22 (container: `app`) | 提供量化重启次数佐证 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 层面的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态与 `exitCode=2` (证据 #1, #2) 直接对应 Prometheus 的 `restart_count` 数据 (证据 #8)。应用日志 (证据 #5, #6) 显示应用在处理特定 `/work` 请求时返回 500 并伴随 `runtime process exiting`，Tempo 追踪数据 (证据 #7) 进一步确认了 `aiops.observed_mode: runtime_exit` 这一应用层现象。这些跨维度的事实一致指向应用内部逻辑错误导致进程主动终止，而非底层资源或调度问题。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPython 应用逻辑(server.py)处理 `/work` 请求时发生未捕获异常 → 应用触发异常处理并执行退出逻辑 → 进程以 exitCode=2 终止 → 触发 K8s CrashLoopBackOff 及 PodsNotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** 应用容器 `app` 内部存在代码缺陷（逻辑 bug），在处理 HTTP `/work` 接口请求时引发未捕获异常，导致应用程序主动以退出码 2 终止自身进程，进而引发 Kubernetes 的 CrashLoopBackOff 循环。\n\n该结论由以下证据链支撑：\n1. **现象锁定**：K8s 状态显示容器以 Error 终止（证据 #1）且 Pod 不 Ready（证据 #4）；\n2. **代码逻辑关联**：日志明确显示进程退出消息 `runtime process exiting` 仅在请求 `/work` 且状态码为 500 时出现（证据 #5），排除了外部依赖故障；\n3. **时序与状态一致**：Tempo 追踪数据 `aiops.observed_mode: runtime_exit` 与日志现象完全吻合（证据 #7），确认了应用层的主动退出行为。\n\n**未确认部分：**\n具体触发该异常的精确代码堆栈或变量状态、以及确切的异常类型（如 `ZeroDivisionError` 还是 `KeyError`）因日志未包含完整堆栈信息而无法确定（参见输入中的 `unknowns` 字段）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b` | CrashLoopBackOff | App container `app` is crashing repeatedly (exitCode=2, CrashLoopBackOff) due to an unhandled runtime error within the Python application logic (server.py) while handling HTTP requests to `/work`. The logs consistently show a 500 status followed by `runtime process exiting`, indicating the application terminates the process upon encountering this specific internal error condition. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container `app`: `last_terminated_reason=Error`, `waiting_reason=CrashLoopBackOff` | 确认容器异常终止并处于重试等待状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container `app`: `last_exit_code=2`, `restart_count=22` | 确认退出码为 2 且已重启多次 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Back-off restarting failed container app (x406 over 91m) | 确认重启行为持续时间及频率极高 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | pod `workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b`: `ContainersReady=False`, `Ready=False` | 确认 Pod 因容器未就绪而无法提供服务 |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | Log pattern: `http_request error runtime process exiting` (HTTP 500, path `/work`, service `aiops-lab-workload`), count: 3 (13:34 - 13:49) | 确认异常发生在处理 `/work` 请求时，且伴随进程直接退出消息 |\n| 6 | Logging | Elasticsearch | Log pattern: `http_request info request completed` (HTTP 200, path `/work`, service `aiops-lab-workload`), count: 5 | 确认应用能处理其他请求，异常非全局不可用 |\n| 7 | Tracing | Tempo | Span `GET /work` in `aiops-lab-workload` has attribute `aiops.observed_mode: runtime_exit` | 在应用层追踪中确认运行模式异常为退出状态，印证日志现象 |\n| 8 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 22 (container: `app`) | 提供量化重启次数佐证 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 层面的 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态与 `exitCode=2` (证据 #1, #2) 直接对应 Prometheus 的 `restart_count` 数据 (证据 #8)。应用日志 (证据 #5, #6) 显示应用在处理特定 `/work` 请求时返回 500 并伴随 `runtime process exiting`，Tempo 追踪数据 (证据 #7) 进一步确认了 `aiops.observed_mode: runtime_exit` 这一应用层现象。这些跨维度的事实一致指向应用内部逻辑错误导致进程主动终止，而非底层资源或调度问题。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPython 应用逻辑(server.py)处理 `/work` 请求时发生未捕获异常 → 应用触发异常处理并执行退出逻辑 → 进程以 exitCode=2 终止 → 触发 K8s CrashLoopBackOff 及 PodsNotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** 应用容器 `app` 内部存在代码缺陷（逻辑 bug），在处理 HTTP `/work` 接口请求时引发未捕获异常，导致应用程序主动以退出码 2 终止自身进程，进而引发 Kubernetes 的 CrashLoopBackOff 循环。\n\n该结论由以下证据链支撑：\n1. **现象锁定**：K8s 状态显示容器以 Error 终止（证据 #1）且 Pod 不 Ready（证据 #4）；\n2. **代码逻辑关联**：日志明确显示进程退出消息 `runtime process exiting` 仅在请求 `/work` 且状态码为 500 时出现（证据 #5），排除了外部依赖故障；\n3. **时序与状态一致**：Tempo 追踪数据 `aiops.observed_mode: runtime_exit` 与日志现象完全吻合（证据 #7），确认了应用层的主动退出行为。\n\n**未确认部分：**\n具体触发该异常的精确代码堆栈或变量状态、以及确切的异常类型（如 `ZeroDivisionError` 还是 `KeyError`）因日志未包含完整堆栈信息而无法确定（参见输入中的 `unknowns` 字段）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

